DEPLOYMENT
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Environment Setup:
  Required:
    • RELAYER_URL env var (or default: http://localhost:8004)
    • Relayer service running with endpoints:
      - POST /execute (submit contract call)
      - GET /tx/{hash} (check status)
      - GET /nonce/{address} (get account nonce)
      - GET /health (health check)

Database:
  • SQLite auto-initialized on first run
  • Located: backend/data/executions.db
  • Size: ~1MB per 10k executions
  • Backup: Regular snapshots recommended

Deployment Command:
  $ cd /opt/obsqra.starknet/zkdefi
  $ pm2 restart zkdefi-backend
  # Wait for worker to start (check logs)
  # Verify: curl http://localhost:8003/health


